# Release build after `src/` changes

Whenever you edit, add, or delete anything under `src/`, finish by running `/dotnet-build Release` (or the project `dotnet-build` skill / `dotnet build src/GlobalStrategy.Core.sln -c Release` logged to `.tmp/dotnet-build.log`).

Release is required even if Debug tests already passed — it writes Unity plugin DLLs under `Assets/Plugins/Core/`. Stop and report on build failure.
